on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [  5] extcall 58 .............................. <soundBusy(1)>
  [  8] not ..................................... <not soundBusy(1)>
  [  9] jmpifz [ 20] ............................ if not soundBusy(1) then / else
  [ 12] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 14] extcall 68 .............................. play done
  [ 17] jmp [ 29]
  [ 20] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 21] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [ 23] extcall 2 ............................... <marker(0)>
  [ 25] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0)>
  [ 27] extcall 3 ............................... go(marker(0))
  [ 29] ret
end
